## Your PO Review Flow is ready

**File:** `POReview/POReview/POReview.flow`

### What was built

| Node | Type | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| **Start** | Manual trigger | You kick it off yourself whenever you're ready to review |
| **Review Purchase Order** | HITL Quick Form | Displays PO Number, Vendor, and Amount for you to review; has an **Approve** button and a **Reject** button; includes a Comments field you can fill in |
| **Log PO Approved** | Script | Logs a confirmation message with PO details when you approve |
| **End** | End node | Graceful flow completion after approval |

### How it works

- **Approve** → the flow continues to the log script, records the approval, then ends normally.
- **Reject** → the HITL form terminates the flow immediately — no logging, nothing else happens.

The form shows three **input fields** (pre-filled from flow inputs): PO Number, Vendor, Amount — and one **output field** (your comments). When you trigger the flow you can pass those values in; they'll appear on the form for context.

